# /sync-to-crm

Generalizes Topwater's `/sync-to-affinity` (recorded there as a live
placeholder — this template exists to keep that same honesty rather than
paper over it: a connector's write-back capability is either wired and
tested, or the skill says plainly that it isn't).

---

## What this skill does

Writes scored/qualified {{vocabulary.entityPlural}} back into the
configured `crm` connector(s) with `crmWrite` capability
({{connectors.crm}}) as records — tier, rationale, red flags, and whatever
fields that CRM's own schema expects, mapped per that connector's
`prompt-fragment.md`.
